{"4256670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Picker Magnate Simulator", "steam_appid": 4256670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Picker Magnate Simulator</strong> - is a life simulator about a junk dealer where you start with an empty stall and slowly turn it into a profitable thrift store.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/581304d4d6c1f797b7c9f2e4b8458313.poster.avif?t=1782987064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/581304d4d6c1f797b7c9f2e4b8458313.webm?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/581304d4d6c1f797b7c9f2e4b8458313.mp4?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your shop from scratch: choose the layout and decide what you sell, from everyday junk to rare antiques. Hire workers, assign their roles, and decide where to invest your money: repairs, advertising, more floor space, or new stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Working with items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/b764dc0f047cce44d418da0e1d869fcb.poster.avif?t=1782987064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/b764dc0f047cce44d418da0e1d869fcb.webm?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/b764dc0f047cce44d418da0e1d869fcb.mp4?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy lots in bulk or hunt for one-of-a-kind finds, then sort everything by material, condition, and price. Repair appliances and furniture using your own equipment or outsource the work, and craft handmade items to sell them at a premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Life of a junk dealer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/7f3c203ed248ba64f25ee77d7ab6e644.poster.avif?t=1782987064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/7f3c203ed248ba64f25ee77d7ab6e644.webm?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/7f3c203ed248ba64f25ee77d7ab6e644.mp4?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just a shop owner but also a driver, loader, negotiator, and sometimes the local troublemaker. Upgrade your strength, speed, and bargaining skills to carry more, push for better prices, and feel like the king of resale.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Picker Magnate Simulator</strong> - is a life simulator about a junk dealer where you start with an empty stall and slowly turn it into a profitable thrift store.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/581304d4d6c1f797b7c9f2e4b8458313.poster.avif?t=1782987064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/581304d4d6c1f797b7c9f2e4b8458313.webm?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/581304d4d6c1f797b7c9f2e4b8458313.mp4?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your shop from scratch: choose the layout and decide what you sell, from everyday junk to rare antiques. Hire workers, assign their roles, and decide where to invest your money: repairs, advertising, more floor space, or new stock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Working with items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/b764dc0f047cce44d418da0e1d869fcb.poster.avif?t=1782987064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/b764dc0f047cce44d418da0e1d869fcb.webm?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/b764dc0f047cce44d418da0e1d869fcb.mp4?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy lots in bulk or hunt for one-of-a-kind finds, then sort everything by material, condition, and price. Repair appliances and furniture using your own equipment or outsource the work, and craft handmade items to sell them at a premium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Life of a junk dealer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/7f3c203ed248ba64f25ee77d7ab6e644.poster.avif?t=1782987064\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/7f3c203ed248ba64f25ee77d7ab6e644.webm?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/extras/7f3c203ed248ba64f25ee77d7ab6e644.mp4?t=1782987064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just a shop owner but also a driver, loader, negotiator, and sometimes the local troublemaker. Upgrade your strength, speed, and bargaining skills to carry more, push for better prices, and feel like the king of resale.</p>", "short_description": "Buy junk, hunt for rare treasures, and turn it all into profit in your own resale shop. Haggle with sellers, repair antiques yourself or through hired workers, craft handmade, and level up your skills to carry and sell more. If you hate hauling heavy stuff, buy a vehicle. Build your resale empire.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Hungarian, Vietnamese, Greek, Danish, Indonesian, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Finnish, Czech, Swedish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/ce0f37444eee24e8390c2e968ca34cce9e24c5e6/header.jpg?t=1782987064", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/70bb559f3ed046fd11788ca897c942703d35b9a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782987064", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256670/70bb559f3ed046fd11788ca897c942703d35b9a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782987064", "website": "https://sgradegames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows (64-bit) 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3550 / RYZEN 5 2500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> N